# CI lint/test tooling (a dev-dependency): the Linterpol image bundles the linters used here
# (hadolint, actionlint, shellcheck, biome) plus container-structure-test. Not shipped in the images.
# Single source for the pin, read by scripts/test.sh and the build-image.yml structure-test step.
# Tracks Linterpol's `1` major line, digest-pinned so a run is reproducible. Renovate bumps the digest
# per upstream release and raises `2` as its own major PR (.github/renovate.jsonc, dev-dependencies).
# renovate: datasource=docker depName=ghcr.io/lahaluhem/linterpol
LINTERPOL_IMAGE=ghcr.io/lahaluhem/linterpol:1@sha256:c3f9a722c9a10fda39be7d4fd3bd2863bd24fa00113bf47562b289f76200ed1a

# The official renovate image, used only by `scripts/test.sh renovate` to schema-check
# .github/renovate.jsonc. Its own image because the validator is a Node tool and Linterpol carries
# no runtimes. Tracks the current major, digest-pinned. APPENDIX.md#renovate-version-tracking
# renovate: datasource=docker depName=ghcr.io/renovatebot/renovate
RENOVATE_IMAGE=ghcr.io/renovatebot/renovate:44@sha256:4f5a2621afd6629fda621e5c66221d1000f0ef3330ec14c828d7e8d357f03522
